{"narration": "¿Sabes qué mira un mecánico en los primeros diez segundos que llegas al taller? No es lo que crees. Primero, la cadena: si cuelga mucho, ya te está robando fuerza. Segundo, las llantas: si están lisas o gastadas de un lado, ya no frenan igual. Tercero, el humo del escape: si sale azul, está quemando aceite. Y lo último… cómo suena la moto en mínima. ¿Tu moto pasaría la prueba? Escríbenos y la revisamos.", "words": [["¿Sabes", 0.013, 0.479], ["qué", 0.492, 0.612], ["mira", 0.625, 0.931], ["un", 0.944, 1.051], ["mecánico", 1.064, 1.622], ["en", 1.636, 1.702], ["los", 1.716, 1.875], ["primeros", 1.888, 2.367], ["diez", 2.38, 2.58], ["segundos", 2.593, 3.085], ["que", 3.098, 3.205], ["llegas", 3.218, 3.644], ["al", 3.657, 3.79], ["taller?", 3.803, 4.255], ["No", 5.077, 5.359], ["es", 5.372, 5.561], ["lo", 5.574, 5.668], ["que", 5.682, 5.816], ["crees.", 5.829, 6.34], ["Primero,", 7.172, 7.71], ["la", 8.032, 8.127], ["cadena:", 8.14, 8.691], ["si", 9.195, 9.432], ["cuelga", 9.445, 9.745], ["mucho,", 9.757, 10.157], ["ya", 10.432, 10.582], ["te", 10.595, 10.707], ["está", 10.72, 10.97], ["robando", 10.982, 11.42], ["fuerza.", 11.432, 11.92], ["Segundo,", 12.597, 13.27], ["las", 13.586, 13.764], ["llantas:", 13.778, 14.437], ["si", 14.941, 15.163], ["están", 15.176, 15.485], ["lisas", 15.498, 15.869], ["o", 15.881, 15.931], ["gastadas", 15.943, 16.438], ["de", 16.451, 16.537], ["un", 16.55, 16.686], ["lado,", 16.698, 16.995], ["ya", 17.267, 17.391], ["no", 17.404, 17.54], ["frenan", 17.552, 17.911], ["igual.", 17.923, 18.319], ["Tercero,", 19.008, 19.626], ["el", 19.915, 20.121], ["humo", 20.135, 20.368], ["del", 20.382, 20.547], ["escape:", 20.56, 21.11], ["si", 21.63, 21.863], ["sale", 21.875, 22.145], ["azul,", 22.157, 22.5], ["está", 22.806, 23.064], ["quemando", 23.076, 23.468], ["aceite.", 23.48, 23.958], ["Y", 24.614, 24.748], ["lo", 24.762, 24.896], ["último…", 24.91, 25.447], ["cómo", 26.139, 26.386], ["suena", 26.399, 26.696], ["la", 26.708, 26.819